{{!
  Create use case: validate the input, build the entity through its Factory, save it, return the Notification.
  jakarta.transaction.Transactional and no @Service: TransactionalConventionTest (application/src/test/.../
  architecture) enforces the first, and the context's <Ctx>BeanConfig registers every *UseCase class.
  Exemplars: therapeutic-relation-usecase .../exclusion/usecase/CreateTherapeuticExclusionUseCase.java,
             .../DeleteTherapeuticExclusionUseCase.java (request validation first)
  Target: <capability>-usecase/src/main/java/<pkg>/Create<Name>UseCase.java
  Package: "package" is the full package of the file (no suffix is appended).
  Vars:   package, Name, name, domainPackage, portPackage, fields[name, Cap]
          (the input is Create<Name>Request from usecase/request, in the same package)
  Left to you: resolving the caller (AuthenticationFacade), lookups through other use cases, events.
}}
